3. Disable USB Autosuspend

   $ lsusb
   $ grep 045e /sys/bus/usb/devices/*/idVendor
   $ echo on | sudo tee /sys/bus/usb/devices/2-4/power/control

   $ head /sys/bus/usb/devices/*/idVendor
   $ head /sys/bus/usb/devices/*/power/control

